[ti:A Car Crash]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.67]Lesson 87 | 第87课
[00:03.07]A car crash | 一场车祸
[00:05.54]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.39]Can the mechanics repair Mr. Wood's car? | 机械师能修好伍德先生的车吗?
[00:17.39]Is my car ready yet? | 我的车修好了吗?
[00:20.12]I don't know, sir. | 先生,我不知道。
[00:22.27]What's the number of your car? | 您的车牌号是多少?
[00:25.57]It's LFZ 312 G. | 是LFZ 312 G。
[00:32.18]When did you bring it to us? | 您什么时候把车送到我们这儿的?
[00:35.40]I brought it here three days ago. | 我三天前送到这儿的。
[00:39.11]Ah yes, I remember now. | 啊,是的,我想起来了。
[00:42.95]Have your mechanics finished yet? | 您的机械师们修完了吗?
[00:46.27]No, they're still working on it. | 不,他们还在修。
[00:49.56]Let's go into the garage and have a look at it. | 让我们去车库看看吧。
[00:55.76]Isn't that your car? | 那不是您的车吗?
[00:58.75]Well, it was my car. | 嗯,以前是我的车。
[01:02.54]Didn't you have a crash? | 您没出过车祸吗?
[01:05.23]That's right. | 是的。
[01:06.95]I drove it into a lamp-post. | 我把它撞到了灯柱上。
[01:10.40]Can your mechanics repair it? | 你们的机械师能修好它吗?
[01:13.54]Well, they're trying to repair it, sir. | 嗯,他们正在努力修,先生。
[01:17.02]But to tell you the truth, you need a new car! | 但说实话,您需要一辆新车!